          "accent": "blue",
          "decor": false
        },
        "presenterNotes": "- trial_rounds (5) red pipelines: fleetd tells it to escalate\n- review_rounds (5) with threads open: fleetd tells it to escalate\n- Dead: Heal in place (a paused one once its wake is due, never Anchored)\n- Reap ends it from any state on merge, Done or Cancelled"
      },
      "name": "Worker"
    },
